[194.302864, "i", "cat > /app/black/notes_for_testing.txt <<'EOF'\nKey functions / areas to fuzz in black:\n- black.format_str(): core formatter for Python source strings; handles syntax parsing and reformatting.\n- black.format_file_contents(): formatting entire file contents.\n- Mode configuration and line selection (sanitized_lines / adjusted_lines).\nFocus on malformed/partial Python code, unusual encodings, very long lines, and edge cases in string normalization.\nEOF\n"]
